@startuml Benchmark_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

actor User #lightgreen
participant "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator #lightyellow
participant "Benchmark\nRunner" as BenchmarkRunner #lightblue
participant "Main Node" as MainNode #lavender
participant "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ #wheat
participant "Worker" as Worker #lightcyan
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer #pink

== 2. Execute Experiments ==

note over BenchmarkRunner
  Loop: For each experiment
  in the benchmark suite
end note

BenchmarkRunner ->> MainNode: **Start Experiment** (sync)\n//perform_experiment()//
activate MainNode
MainNode -->> BenchmarkRunner: //{'status': 'running'}//

loop Optimization iterations
    MainNode -> MainNode: **Select configurations**\n//ConfigurationSelection//
    MainNode ->> RabbitMQ: **Publish tasks**\n//task_queue//
    activate RabbitMQ
    RabbitMQ ->> Worker: **Dispatch task**
    activate Worker
    Worker -> Worker: **Run experiments**\n//worker_method()//
    Worker ->> RabbitMQ: **Publish results**\n//task_result_exchange//
    deactivate Worker
    RabbitMQ ->> MainNode: **Deliver results**
    deactivate RabbitMQ
    MainNode -> MainNode: **Update model**\n//add_configuration()//
end

note over MainNode
  Stop condition reached
end note

@enduml

